[{"client_msg_id":"6a2b58d9-3de5-4ab0-ba66-75ebff97ec4b","type":"message","user":"US5UW1UNB","text":"んー？\n自分なら条件のほうを `'bar' in foo` か `Object.prototype.propertyIsEnumerable.call(foo, 'bar')`  (うーん長い！ｗ) かな。\nproperty として存在しうるなら `string | undefined` であっているしなあ、と。","ts":"1632045080.276100","thread_ts":"1631986406.239200","subtype":"thread_broadcast","reactions":[{"name":"naruho","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4lx"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"a7ae5273-dfda-43d6-93d9-71f0aa114f2d","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"```type Foo = {\n  [key: string]: string\n}```\nみたいなことをしているときに\n```foo['bar'] != null```\nをチェックすると怒られるし\n```type Foo = {\n  [key: string]: string | undefined\n}```\nすると\n```for (const [k, v] of Object.entries(foo))```\nしたときにvが `string | undefined` になってしまって最悪だからno-unnecessary-conditionを有効化できない・・・","ts":"1631986406.239200","thread_ts":"1631986406.239200","edited":{"user":"U8996GYBF","ts":"1631986429.000000"},"reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zUn"}]}},{"client_msg_id":"45921712-0265-4670-a980-158ead2b6d88","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"どの設定で出るのかめっちゃ気になってます","ts":"1632029825.276000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"neF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c54ac4ce-6e71-404c-8926-5c580774f6cc","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"tsserver レベルの機能なんですかね…？エディタ上ではよく見かけるなあと。","ts":"1632029790.275700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0jJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"76269d98-a749-4f22-96b8-58b4e0023ef3","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"これが気になってる・・・、tsconfigの設定なのか自分は見たことがない\n\u003chttps://twitter.com/hrsh7th/status/1439219107665104899\u003e","ts":"1632026288.274700","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/hr